-------------------------------------------------------------------------

Z3ST is an open-source finite element framework for coupled thermo-mechanical
analysis of multi-material domains.

Developed by:
    Giovanni Zullo
    Politecnico di Milano
    https://github.com/giozu/z3st

Description:
    Z3ST couples heat conduction and linear elasticity in transient or
    stationary conditions, using modular YAML-driven configuration and
    Python-based post-processing tools.

