THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

z3st/models/cohesive_model.py adapts the variational form (elastic energy
density, strength potential and their regularizations) of the reference
implementation accompanying:

    F. Vicentini, J. Heinzmann, P. Carrara, L. De Lorenzis,
    "Variational phase-field modeling of cohesive fracture with flexibly
    tunable strength surface", Journal of the Mechanics and Physics of
    Solids 207 (2026) 106424. doi:10.1016/j.jmps.2025.106424

    https://github.com/jonas-heinzmann/phase_field_cohesive_fracture

